Your answer is correct
C. PCF code component

Explanation
PCF (Power Apps Component Framework) code components allow developers to create custom controls that can be easily added to model-driven forms. By encapsulating the script logic within a PCF component, the behavior can remain reusable and resilient to platform UI changes, providing a more robust solution for the scenario described.
D. Hosted HTML web resource

Explanation
